{"availability":"available","full":"patibandlavenkatamanideep/relayops","name":"relayops","description":"Production-shaped control plane for AI support agents: scoped routing, policy broker, tool boundaries, approval queue, replay verification, audit traces, and human handoff. Prototype on synthetic/sample data — no production users.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-05T16:56:22Z","updated":"2026-07-06T09:16:14Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://relayops-production.up.railway.app/","topics":["agentic-ai","ai-agent","ai-safety","audit-trail","customer-support","fastapi","fine-tuning","guardrails","human-in-the-loop","llm-evaluation","lora","mcp","qwen","rag","railway","streamlit","support-automation","telecom"],"demo":"https://relayops-production.up.railway.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:03:23.980Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T11:03:23.980Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T11:03:23.980Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:26.680Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:25:13.411Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T11:03:23.980Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Production-shaped AI support agent for telecom / subscription billing.","Scoped permissions · route safety · decision traces · audit export · human handoff.","Core thesis: RelayOps treats AI support as a control system: scoped permissions, route safety, decision traces, audit export, and human handoff. Invariant: the model can propose; the broker decides; the tool executes only if allowed; the final reply is generated from the broker decision; the audit trail records every state; the human or organization remains accountable. Roadmap: Hermes reviews the audit trail and drafts follow-up work for human developer review."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/patibandlavenkatamanideep/relayops/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fe08